{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44564","headline":"诗三百三首 二六一 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二六一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见转轮王，千子常围绕。\n十善化四天，庄严多七宝。\n七宝镇随身，庄严甚妙好。\n一朝福报尽，犹若栖芦鸟。\n还作牛领虫，六趣受业道。\n况复诸凡夫，无常岂长保。\n生死如旋火，轮回似麻稻。\n不解早觉悟，爲人枉虚老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}